296	 *
297	 * Description:
298	 *   Full GC9D01 init sequence from ARMINO lcd_spi_gc9d01.c.
299	 *   If display_on is true, sends 0x29 (display on) at the end;
300	 *   otherwise leaves the display off so the caller can fill the
301	 *   framebuffer first (avoids flash of uninitialised GRAM).
